###### <prophe.seed>
..........................
The current education system does not serve humanity, it trains us to function like cogs in a machine we were never meant to serve. The system is literally built to ensure we never realize and remember ourselves.

The future will offer us new methods of education, ones that support the nature preclivities of each individual. No more making everyone learn the same subjects for their entire school life- we teach the fundamentals, and then you are able to focus on your destined skill sets through apprenticeship and other modes of education.

Why should a genius child with a creative spark spent over 10 years learning mathematic principles they will never touch? 

Why should our children sit in classrooms in silence when the world needs people who can speak up for what they believe?
#consideration 
